<div dir=3D"auto">Oh, man. Now Paiute has gotten back to me.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">I do not know what to do.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">I don't think I'm allowed to go home.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">If I stay, I may never see my mom again.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">She tells me to stay. I need to think about it.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">Is the position in September available to me if I change =
my mind?</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">I understand if it's not. I really need to think about th=
is.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">I feel so torn.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">I'm sorry I'm even troubling you with this.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">I get that you have very clear boundaries.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">I don't know how to separate my volunteer work from my pe=
rsonal life - they are the same things to me.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div><br>
</div>
