<div dir=3D"auto">If this would hurt me in any way, I will stay. I just wan=
t to be perfectly clear about that. I bring it up now because I'm planning =
my movements and there are seven months before this assignment, so I trust =
I wouldn't inconvenience you - the
 timing, like everything, is a variable in my contemplations. I would stay,=
 joyfully, not as a concession, as total acceptance of alignment. I make th=
is plea because I don't have assignments for July and August but that time =
is too short for me to go to Kentucky
 and back, and I couldn't go after September because our parks close for th=
e winter. I just don't see a clear way to make this puzzle work - but stayi=
ng is one way, and perhaps going to Kentucky in the spring. After April, wh=
en I finish at Honeyman that season.
 I hope you see I'm trying here. I will stay if breaking my commitment woul=
d cause disharmony.</div>
<div><br>
</div>
